(7192577, 1106485, 152252, '<td valign="top">First of all it''s an amazing shot (composition, pp, etc.). Second it doesn''t look staged - maybe because of the movement. The movement is also what makes me think of depression. It brings some kind of inquietude and chaos to the otherwise quiet image. It makes me feel something is going on with that person... something I don''t understand... something only she can feel. Maybe she''s lost, disturbed, with a million of thoughts flying through her head. She is helpless, insignificant, she seems to be struggling with something she will never defeat... I was really hoping to see something creative and not obvious in this challenge. You made it happen. Thank you.</td>', 'First of all it''s an amazing shot (composition, pp, etc.). Second it doesn''t look staged - maybe because of the movement. The movement is also what makes me think of depression. It brings some kind of inquietude and chaos to the otherwise quiet image. It makes me feel something is going on with that person... something I don''t understand... something only she can feel. Maybe she''s lost, disturbed, with a million of thoughts flying through her head. She is helpless, insignificant, she seems to be struggling with something she will never defeat... I was really hoping to see something creative and not obvious in this challenge. You made it happen. Thank you.', '2014-03-21 19:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
