(7192791, 1106108, 114285, '<td valign="top">I like grainy blurry images, you know I do, but this is one time I think the photo should be in focus, so I can determine what expression they are emanating. I''m sure this is intentional though obviously. Still it leaves a lot to the imagination, and this is still one of my top picks, if not my top pick.</td>', 'I like grainy blurry images, you know I do, but this is one time I think the photo should be in focus, so I can determine what expression they are emanating. I''m sure this is intentional though obviously. Still it leaves a lot to the imagination, and this is still one of my top picks, if not my top pick.', '2014-03-22 22:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
