(7193910, 1106565, 152252, '<td valign="top">First of all I love this image: textures, composition, lighting &amp; pp. Second it does make me think about depression. When we are depressed we often decide to isolate ourselves from everything. Also, so many things seem to be unavailable, impossible... closed... That''s just my interpretation. You should remember about that place next time there is a "Closed" challenge.</td>', 'First of all I love this image: textures, composition, lighting & pp. Second it does make me think about depression. When we are depressed we often decide to isolate ourselves from everything. Also, so many things seem to be unavailable, impossible... closed... That''s just my interpretation. You should remember about that place next time there is a "Closed" challenge.', '2014-03-25 18:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
